  "prefLabel": "Plc 1509.01 Applicability of Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1509.01 Applicability of Standards.\n\n(a) The standards in this part shall apply to each individual who applies to be licensed under RSA 326-E or who is licensed under RSA 326-E.\n\n(b) Violations of these standards shall constitute unprofessional conduct that subjects the violator to disciplinary proceedings pursuant to Plc 1510.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
